So, we can conclude that $-1\\le x\\le -\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ notice that for $0\\le \\theta <2\\pi,$ we have $-1\\le \\operatorname{sin}\\theta\\le 1.$ Consequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{sin}\\theta \\le 1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\text{ }\\ge -\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}\\theta \\text{ }\\ge -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & \\le -\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}\\theta \\le \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{7}{2} & \\le -\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}\\theta +\\frac{7}{2}\\le \\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ \\frac{19}{6} & \\le y\\le \\frac{23}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $\\frac{19}{6}\\le y\\le \\frac{23}{6}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526260 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee293cc5-69a9-52fb-997c-1b6841614969" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{25}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526289}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526289} :answer-field/id #uuid "2042e91b-9fc0-5244-b482-8c216903850a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526233} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e210e58-5a33-54d1-836e-1486c247f717" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526244}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526244} :answer-field/id #uuid "4feceda9-b71d-5a21-8623-104a1b674557" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526252} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "83fd4cb5-6afe-5998-bcf9-7d25e19495e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526263}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526263} :answer-field/id #uuid "70d8687f-af5c-5c95-bb0a-2972ca5b878d" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 1759